,"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116716#pullrequestreview-3848200925","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116716","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116716#pullrequestreview-3848200925"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116716"}},"submitted_at":"2026-02-24T14:14:42Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3871807326,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7mxxde","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?u=f6c14ec512c7cd33f8d109f121e89b7e60e42f38&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I created a commit in one of my fork's branch to decouple `Input` from `VirtualController` and `scene/` files: https://github.com/Nintorch/godot/commit/a9319132353b495010299793fda185acd2ba5802\r\nIn that same commit I also deregistered `VirtualController` so its nodes can't be created in scenes directly by the user, I'm not currently sure it makes sense to allow that since the current functionality of enabling it through the `Input` property and a project setting should be enough, unless we want to allow the users to create 2 or more `VirtualController`s or allow them to be freely modified. :) (EDIT: I just noticed that you're planning to make `VirtualController` customizable, in this case it does make sense for its nodes to be created directly by the user, so you can ignore that change by me in my commit! :D)\r\nI also tested the functionality of `VirtualController` on Windows today. I think it mostly works as expected, except for 2 notes here:\r\n1. I think when the `VirtualController` is visible, Godot should register it as a connected joypad, so projects like https://gist.github.com/anthonyec/5342fce79b2b7b22ada748df0ad7f7c0 and joypad functions like `Input.get_joy_axis()` or `Input.is_joy_button_pressed()` can also be used with it.\r\n2. `VirtualController` is not suited for smaller output sizes at the moment. This can be a problem if it's used for pixel art games.\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>VirtualController with a regular size</summary>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1159\" height=\"689\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6783c466-4145-4ace-b339-dddeb5f1fe57\" />\r\n</details>\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>VirtualController with a smaller size</summary>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1488\" height=\"846\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/59f52fe6-5779-49f8-86cc-701f224c9ea1\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nOtherwise I think it looks nicely done! :)","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116716#pullrequestreview-3871807326","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116716","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116716#pullrequestreview-3871807326"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116716"}},"submitted_at":"2026-03-01T09:49:05Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3872444634,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7m0NDa","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?u=f6c14ec512c7cd33f8d109f121e89b7e60e42f38&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116716#pullrequestreview-3872444634","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116716","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116716#pullrequestreview-3872444634"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoten